444  Author: Yannay
445  Name:           table8_linear_quart.sas
446  Input:          base_ns.sas (data file with national security
446! variables)
447  Output:         t8_lin_q_&outcome.sas7bdat
448
449  Description:    This program produces the OLS outcomes by lagged-score
450                  quartiles for table 8.
451                  For each outcome it produces a separate table.
452
453  Instructions:   (*) Set the "home" libname below to the path of the
453! folder
454                      in which the national security file is held
455                  (*) Set the "target" libname below to the path of the
455! folder
456                      where the results tables should be written
457                  (*) Run the program
458
459  NOTE:   The results are not set in the same order as in the
460          paper that appears in the table, and there are additional
461          results that don't show in the paper (namely the panel with
462          "1_main" as rowname).
463          The results that show in the paper are only those that appear
464          under columns whose titles start with
465          "c_ls_b" (lagged-score halves, boys) and
466          "c_ls_g" (lagged-score halves, girls).
467          Each estimator shows with 3 different standard errors:
468          Stderr:     clustered s.e.s (not reported in the paper)
469          RobSE:      Robust s.e.s (reported in the paper)
470          NoClusSE:   Conventional s.e. (not reported in the paper)
471
472  ********************************************************************/
